i-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-style:italic;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"color:#2B6CA3;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:17px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-family:caudex,serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Harissa Shrimp Scampi</span></span></span></span></span></a></h5>\n\n<h5 class=\"font_5 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:17px;\"><span style=\"font-style:italic;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"color:#2B6CA3;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:17px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-family:caudex,serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixGuard wixui-rich-text__text\">​</span></span></span></span></span></span></h5>","skin":"WRichTextNewSkin","isQaMode":false,"fullNameCompType":"wysiwyg.viewer.components.WRichText"},"comp-jl825niz":{"translations":{"title":"Widget Didn’t Load","text1":"Check your internet and refresh this page.","text2":"If that doesn’t work, contact us."}},"comp-jl825nk5":{},"comp-jl825nl4":{"html":"<h1 class=\"font_0 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:35px;\"><span style=\"font-size:52px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-family:caudex,serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Spicy Slap Ya Mama </span></span></h1>\n\n<h1 class=\"font_0 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:35px;\"><span style=\"font-size:52px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-family:caudex,serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Skillet Shrimp Salad</span></span></h1>","skin":"WRichTextNewSkin","isQaMode":false,"fullNameCompType":"wysiwyg.viewer.components.WRichText"},"comp-jl825nm8":{"html":"<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-style:italic;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Ingredients</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">serves 2&nbsp;</span></p>","skin":"WRichTextNewSkin","isQaMode":false,"fullNameCompType":"wysiwyg.viewer.components.WRichText"},"comp-jl825nna":{"html":"<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\">1 pound&nbsp;large raw gulf shrimp</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\">3 1/2 teaspoons Slap Ya Mama Pepper Seasoning</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\">1 tablespoon&nbsp;minced garlic</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\">1 tablespoon minced shallot</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\">1 tablespoon finely minced fresh parsley</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\">3 tablespoons champagne or white wine vinegar</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\">1/3 cup quality Olive Oil</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\">1 1/2 teaspoons spicy brown or dijon mustard</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\">1/2 teaspoon Salt</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\">1/2 teaspoon pepper</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\">6 cups mixed salad greens</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\">1/4 cup thinly sliced red onion</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\">1/4 cup cucumber slices cut in half</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\">2 small meaty&nbsp;tomatoes sliced into wedges</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\">14 oz can Chickpeas, drained and rinsed</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\">1 lemon&nbsp;sliced into wedges</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\">Home made croutons</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span class=\"wixGuard wixui-rich-text__text\">​</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span class=\"wixGuard wixui-rich-text__text\">​</span></p>","skin":"WRichTextNewSkin","isQaMode":false,"fullNameCompType":"wysiwyg.viewer.components.WRichText"},"comp-jl825nqo":{"pinUrl":"https://www.pinterest.com/pin/637329784744495912/","isConsentPolicyActive":false,"isMobile":false,"translations":{"componentName":"Share from Pinterest","large_element_one_cookie":"<%=componentname%> was blocked due to your <%=cookietype%> cookie settings. <url>Update your settings<url> ","large_element_two_cookie":"<%=componentname%> was blocked due to your <%=cookietype%> and <%=cookietype%> cookie settings. <url>Update your settings<url>","medium_element_one_cookie":"To view <%=componentname%>, <url>adjust your <%=cookietype%> cookie settings.<url>","medium_element_two_cookie":"To view <%=componentname%>, <url>adjust your <%=cookietype%> and <%=cookietype%> cookie settings.<url>","small_element_one_cookie":"<url>Update your cookie settings<url>","small_element_two_cookie":"<url>Update your cookie settings<url>","small_tooltip_one_cookie":"To view <%=componentname%>, update your <%=cookietype%> settings.","small_tooltip_two_cookie":"To view <%=componentname%>, update your <%=cookietype%> and <%=cookietype%> settings.","small_element_aria_label":"More info","tiny_element_one_cookie":"<%=componentname%> was blocked due to your <%=cookietype%> cookie settings. <url>Update your settings<url>","tiny_element_two_cookie":"<%=componentname%> was blocked due to your <%=cookietype%> and <%=cookietype%> cookie settings. <url>Update your settings<url>","tiny_element_aria_label":"Unblock <%=componentname%>","analytics":"analytics","functional":"functional","essential":"essential","advertising":"marketing"}},"comp-jl825noh":{"html":"<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-style:italic;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Method</span></span></span></p>","skin":"WRichTextNewSkin","isQaMode":false,"fullNameCompType":"wysiwyg.viewer.components.WRichText"},"comp-jl825npk":{"html":"<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">For the Slap Ya Mama Vinaigrette:</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Mix the minced garlic, shallot and parsley in&nbsp;a bowl or jar. Add the spicy brown mustard, 1/2 teaspoon Slap Ya Mama seasoning, olive oil, vinegar,&nbsp;salt &amp; pepper and whisk or shake until well blended and creamy.</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixGuard wixui-rich-text__text\">​</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">For the Slap Ya Mama&nbsp;Shrimp:</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Peel and devein the shrimp then marinade for 15-30 minutes in 3&nbsp;tablespoons of the vinaigrette&nbsp;and 3 teaspoons of Slap Ya Mama Pepper blend.</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixGuard wixui-rich-text__text\">​</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Start heating a dry cast iron skillet on medium high heat until very hot while preparing the salad.</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixGuard wixui-rich-text__text\">​</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">For the Salad:</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Add the mixed greens, red onion, chickpeas, and croutons to a large salad bowl. Toss the salad with the rest of the Spicy brown mustard vinaigrette.</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixGuard wixui-rich-text__text\">​</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">To Cook the Shrimp:</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">When the pan is very hot,&nbsp;add the shrimp to the skillet and don&#39;t move them. Sear them in batches being careful not to crowd them in the pan. When they naturally release from the pan (about 2 minutes) turn them over and sear the other side.&nbsp;As the shrimp finish, remove them to a clean bowl to keep warm.</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixGuard wixui-rich-text__text\">​</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">To Serve:​</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">When all of the shrimp are seared,&nbsp;divide the salad between 2 or 3 large shallow bowls and top each with the shrimp. Serve immediately with the lemon wedges and some crusty bread.</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixGuard wixui-rich-text__text\">​</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixGuard wixui-rich-text__text\">​</span></span></p>","skin":"WRichTextNewSkin","isQaMode":false,"fullNameCompType":"wysiwyg.viewer.components.WRichText"},"comp-jl825nru":{"id":"comp-jl825nru","appDefinitionId":"13016589-a9eb-424a-8a69-46cb05ce0b2c","widgetId":"130165ba-4eeb-4a87-3121-a3cf2a86d2ca","isAppInClientSpecMap":true,"isViewerMode":true,"isResponsive":false,"translations":{"preloaderOverlay":{"loading":"Loading"},"errorMessageOverlay":{"reloadText":"Refresh this page","oopsText":"App Didn't Load","installErrorText":"We Were Unable to Install This App","generalErrorPrefix":"Try again later, disable any ad blockers, or reload the page. Contact the author of","generalErrorSuffi